kosmickrisp: import images from MTLTexture handles

Implement VK_EXTERNAL_MEMORY_HANDLE_TYPE_MTLTEXTURE_BIT_EXT import from
VK_EXT_external_memory_metal. The texture is retained and used as the
image storage, so the import is dedicated-only. An imported texture is
renderable even when it is linear (e.g. IOSurface backed), so linear
MTLTexture imports may be color attachments.

